  "body_html": "<h1>Optimal Pairs Are Exactly Saddle Points</h1>\n<p>For a finite matrix game $A$, the product $X(A)\\times Y(A)$ of optimal-strategy\nsets is exactly the set of saddle points of $A$.</p>",
